17. STRING COPY — strcpy()
------------------------------------------------------------

Header:

#include <string.h>


Example:

char source[] = "Hello";
char destination[20];

strcpy(destination, source);


Now:

destination = "Hello"


IMPORTANT:

destination must have enough space for:

