32. strtok() LIMITATIONS
------------------------------------------------------------

strtok() maintains parsing state internally.

This can make it unsuitable for:

    - nested tokenization
    - concurrent use
    - situations requiring independent parser state

For more complex parsing, manually track positions or use an
appropriate reentrant/platform-specific tokenizer where
available.


