41. STRING REVERSAL
------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

"Hello"

becomes:

"olleH"


Implementation:

void reverseString(char str[])
{
    size_t length = strlen(str);

    if (length == 0)
        return;

    size_t left = 0;
    size_t right = length - 1;

    while (left < right)
    {
        char temp = str[left];

        str[left] = str[right];
        str[right] = temp;

        left++;
        right--;
    }
}


------------------------------------------------------------
42. STRING PALINDROME
------------------------------------------------------------

A palindrome reads the same forward and backward.

Examples:

madam
level
radar


Algorithm:

    compare first and last
    compare second and second-last
    continue toward center


Example:

int isPalindrome(const char str[])
{
    size_t left = 0;
    size_t right = strlen(str);

    if (right == 0)
        return 1;

    right--;

    while (left < right)
    {
        if (str[left] != str[right])
            return 0;

        left++;
        right--;
    }

    return 1;
}


