47. REMOVE SPACES
------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

Input:

H e l l o


Output:

Hello


Two-pointer technique:

void removeSpaces(char str[])
{
    size_t read = 0;
    size_t write = 0;

    while (str[read] != '\0')
    {
        if (str[read] != ' ')
        {
            str[write++] = str[read];
        }

        read++;
    }

    str[write] = '\0';
}


Time:

O(n)

Extra space:

O(1)


